      "docs / CHANGELOG / .changeset / content/docs / docs": "prose about the retirement, never an authored stack",
      "tests + test ledgers (*.test.ts, /test/, *.fixtures.ts)": "fixtures that feed retired names deliberately to assert the refusal; a lint finding on them is the point, not a migration",
      "spec vocabulary machinery (page.zod.ts, component.zod.ts, component-type-vocabulary.ts)": "the retirement map itself and the prescription strings -- the very text the rule relays",
      "conversion / migration registries (packages/spec/src/conversions, packages/spec/src/migrations)": "ADR-0087 conversion fixture data replayed by the conversion harness, never fed to the authoring commands (the rule's own docblock already names this class)",
